{"title":"USG assets are worth less than Arnold Kling had thought","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/972870635/0/marginalrevolution~USG-assets-are-worth-less-than-Arnold-Kling-had-thought.html","date":1794470495000,"content":"<blockquote><p><strong>Federal oil and gas rights are worth about $625 billion on the paper’s own method, down 75% in real terms since 1981.</strong> Federal land has gone the other way, to roughly $1.1 trillion to $1.6 trillion. Land, not minerals, is now the larger asset.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/us-government-assets?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=338673&amp;post_id=223319870&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">the full post</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/usg-assets-are-worth-less-than-arnold-kling-had-thought.html\">USG assets are worth less than Arnold Kling had thought</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/972870635/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/972870635/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/972870635/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/972870635/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/972870635/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.p